    "title": "Reverse Alternate K Nodes in Linked List",
    "category": "Linked List",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given the head of a singly linked list and an integer k, reverse the first k nodes, leave the next k nodes unchanged, then reverse the following k nodes, and continue this pattern until the end of the list. Return the head of the modified linked list.",
    "input": "Integer n Linked list Integer k",
    "output": "The modified linked list.",
    "constraints": "1 <= n <= 10^5 1 <= k <= n"
